MODULE: UndoRedirectBeforeSwapRedirectOmitted
TARGET: UndoRedirectBeforeSwap
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the resized copy is not armed before undo swaps the alias back
PERTURBS: UndoRedirect

--- FIND
    /\ redirect' = [redirect EXCEPT !["resized"] = source]
--- REPLACE
    /\ redirect' = redirect
--- END
